# Vendoring

Use `scripts/vendor.sh <repo-root>` when CI cannot access this shared skill.
The source skill must be committed and clean. The destination receives scripts
at `tools/spec/`, template at `tools/spec/template/`, and `VENDORED.md` with
source repository, latest skill commit, skill tree identity and the MIT notice.
A repeated copy is unchanged. Updating a clean older copy is permitted only
when its recorded source commit is locally available. Modified copies, extra
files, symlinks or missing provenance are refused; preserve and reconcile
local changes before retrying. Never delete changes to force an update.

The source tools, tests and template originate at
`https://github.com/1wgrumph/gridmarket`, commit
`99eb98e7b0b5d1473c8e595d825d569b567c6817` (MIT).
`LICENSE-gridmarket` retains its copyright and permission notice.
Adaptations: one skill, portable PEP 723 entrypoints, generalized identifiers,
explicit missing-dot status, and provenance-preserving vendoring.

